{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/2ee895c1b0a7e5802981df25e21befe2.avif?t=1758642463\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colony 37 is a mining game with survival elements. Your main goal is to dig as deep as you possible can, earn some cash by selling ores and completing tasks that your fellow miners will give you. Discover hidden underground structures and buy yourself various equipment in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/55a13051275ec55fe6d7ab5a921f723c.avif?t=1758642463\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a <strong>handful of features</strong> a game has to offer.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated world with different biomes and threats you're going to encounter.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At this point the game has 6 distinct biomes each with its own set of resources and threats you'll encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Instruments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickaxes, shovels, drills, nailguns, dynamite, elevators, jump pads... Almost every instrument has its distinct feature and use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Equippable trinkets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them will boost your stats (Health, oxygen capacity, radiation absorption) and some of them will provide you with more... unusual buffs like creating explosions with every hit or a huge boost to your strength for a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay with story elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable characters with a word or two to tell. Some of them can even reward you if you'll complete their tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of resources to gather and sell.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome has its own set of resources to gather, some of them cheaper and more common, some of them worth a fortune but difficult to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/6e02845c24152d67d267720ecde09285.avif?t=1758642463\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can equip up to 3 instruments and up to 7 trinkets at a time. You can combine them in any way you desire to create the perfect build that is able to overcome dangerous descent. While the amount of slots is limited, there is no limitation on what kind of items you will equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/6c695f489eacac76b5ffc6355cb59bd1.avif?t=1758642463\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden secrets of a planet where your mining company is trying to make profit. Maybe you're not the first\u00a0discoverers of this forgotten place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.poster.avif?t=1758642463\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.webm?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.mp4?t=1758642463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869630?t=1758642463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869630?t=1758642463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/d2cb5b89372cce8473302b60cded6dc5ff2296d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758642463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/d2cb5b89372cce8473302b60cded6dc5ff2296d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758642463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},